# Abyssal Gorestalker ({4}{B}{B}, 6/6): "When this creature enters, each player sacrifices two creatures of their choice." Bot1 controls a Memnite and an Ornithopter besides the Gorestalker (three
# creatures), and Bot2 a Memnite, an Ornithopter and a Phyrexian Walker. Each player chooses two (CR 701.21a, 101.4): Bot1, the active player, sacrifices its Memnite and Ornithopter and keeps the 6/6, and Bot2
# sacrifices its Memnite and Ornithopter and keeps the Walker (Bot1's graveyard also holds the sacrificed Black Lotus: three cards); the pool is empty right after the cast, so the cost is exactly {4}{B}{B}.
